        "pageNumber": 1,
        "text": "Drogon was small. Drogon was brave. He wanted to help. He saw a big hill. Can I help?",
        "illustrationPrompt": "A small, green dragon named Drogon stands at the foot of a large, grassy hill. He looks determined. The sky is bright blue with fluffy white clouds. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: greens, blues, yellows."
      },
      {
        "pageNumber": 2,
        "text": "The ants were there. They worked hard. They moved sticks. Drogon saw them. Can I help ants?",
        "illustrationPrompt": "A line of busy ants carries small sticks up the hill. Drogon looks down at them with a friendly smile. The hill is covered in small flowers. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: reds, browns, greens."
      },
      {
        "pageNumber": 3,
        "text": "The ants said, \"Yes!\" Drogon blew soft air. The sticks moved fast. The ants smiled big. It was fun!",
        "illustrationPrompt": "Drogon gently blows air from his nostrils, helping the ants move the sticks. The ants are smiling and waving. Bright sunlight shining. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: yellows, oranges, browns."
      },
      {
        "pageNumber": 4,
        "text": "The birds flew by. They saw Drogon. They saw the ants. They needed help. \"Can you help?\"",
        "illustrationPrompt": "Two colorful birds fly above Drogon and the ants. The birds look concerned. A nest is visible in a tree in the background. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: blues, reds, greens."
      },
      {
        "pageNumber": 5,
        "text": "Drogon said, \"Yes!\" The birds needed twigs. Drogon found twigs. He gave them twigs. Birds were happy.",
        "illustrationPrompt": "Drogon gathers twigs with his tiny claws. He hands the twigs to the birds. The birds chirp happily. The sun shines brightly. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: browns, greens, blues."
      },
      {
        "pageNumber": 6,
        "text": "Drogon, ants, and birds played. They all helped. It was the best day. Friends help friends!",
